::scene TITLE

ROOM studio_stage

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE whitlock_logo

♪ A brass fanfare plays, the kind that used to open the evening news. ♪

::scene COMMERCIAL

CAM 1 WIDE

SHOT
Archive footage, badly restored. Rank after rank of uniformed officers stand in a parade ground that is now, if you know the skyline, four feet under water.
SHOT_END

NARRATOR:
In the old world, Whitlock Arms shipped sixty thousand Model 12 riot guns to the precincts of this city.

NARRATOR:
Every precinct is gone.

3s

NARRATOR:
Every Model 12 still works.

CAM 2 CLOSEUP whitlock_model12

SHOT
A heat-scarred pump-action turns slowly on a velvet cushion, lit like jewellery.
SHOT_END

NARRATOR:
The Whitlock Model 12. Chambered wide. Solves problems in a broad, apologetic spread.

NARRATOR:
Ask yourself: what else from before The Handoff still does exactly what it says on the box?

OVERLAY
WHITLOCK ARMS

WE OUTLASTED THE INSTITUTIONS THAT ORDERED US

THIS IS NOT A BOAST, IT IS A LIABILITY DISCLOSURE
OVERLAY_END

SHOT
Small print scrolls too fast to read, then slows, deliberately, on one line.
SHOT_END

NARRATOR:
Whitlock does not manufacture the sawn-off Doorman. Whoever shortened yours did that themselves, and Whitlock would like that noted.

EVENT FADE_OUT

END
